{"ID":"20240118151321-pb8td73","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151321-pb8td73","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151321-pb8td73\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151321-7sq4pnz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129150725-sg3afr7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122092843-rqmhv46\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:149,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:149\u0026#125;","title":"070飞廉","type":"doc","updated":"20240129150739"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151321-7sq4pnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151321-7sq4pnz","updated":"20240122092828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主骨节热，胫重酸疼，久服令人身轻。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092831-gsdeaor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092831-gsdeaor"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】陶弘景曰处处有之，极似苦芙，叶多缺刻，叶下茎多有皮起。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092833-v346vhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092833-v346vhp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】飞廉根及花味苦，性平。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092835-uevvopn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092835-uevvopn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】飞廉花根为去风湿止痛活血药，能下乳汁及杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092836-gzi6fya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092836-gzi6fya"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】头眩顶重，皮间邪气，如蜂螫针剌，鱼子细起，热疮，痈疽，痔，湿痹，止风邪咳嗽，下乳汁，可煮、可干用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092838-9enj9aj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092838-9enj9aj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】主留血，疗疳蚀，杀虫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092840-tcfo3xd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092840-tcfo3xd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【萧炳】小儿疳痢，为散水服，大效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092841-eece0sn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092841-eece0sn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092842-33gym3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092842-33gym3b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】里有寒，又兼下痢者禁用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122092842-nmrghaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092842-nmrghaa"}},{"ID":"20240122092843-8g62156","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092843-8g62156"}},{"ID":"20240122092843-rqmhv46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122092843-rqmhv46","updated":"20240129150739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第70味药，飞廉。那这种药呢，张仲景都没有用过，我们呢，不是说他不用是不好，现在也很少人去用这些东西，一般来说，飞廉的外皮呢，我们使用在这个皮肤上的问题，哦，被蜜蜂咬到了哦，很多的地方可以利用飞廉，这种地方这个药很多，很便宜的，能够主治的是能够去风湿止痛，下乳汁及杀虫啊，最主要是被蜜蜂咬的，皮肤的咬伤，那任何的药，大家只要记得，当你做外敷的时候，外用的时候，一个是你可以用新鲜的汁，比如说你用新鲜药材用汁挤出来，那个汁，就好象生姜有汁在里面，还有呢，你把它烘焙，烘干后打粉备用，都可以用，那这个药，我本人用得不多。"}]},{"ID":"20240129150725-sg3afr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129150725-sg3afr7"}}]}